From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:14:59 +0000
Subject: feat(ios): render inline-box spans and groups in RichText

An InlineBoxGroupSpan keeps its children as ordinary attributed text
between two edge attachments, joined with U+2060 so TextKit wraps the group
as one word; KRLayoutManager paints the chrome per line fragment. Copy,
selection and the label's text restore the group's semantic text.

